cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the OpenSiro upstream contributions registry, please cite this repository and identify the exact Git commit examined."
title: "OpenSiro Upstream Contributions Registry"
authors:
  - name: "OpenSiro contributors"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Public OpenSiro-owned portfolio and lifecycle registry of contributions
  to third-party open-source projects. The registry records contribution
  outcomes and fork maintenance status without claiming upstream endorsement.
repository-code: "https://github.com/opensiro/upstream"
url: "https://github.com/opensiro/upstream"
keywords:
  - "open-source contributions"
  - "upstream"
  - "contribution registry"
